MiatOff
=======

MiatOff's own code (stick scripts, builders, collector, Meters, GUI, tests) is
GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.

Third-party components
----------------------
vendor/touchtune/TouchTune-1.2.1.zip
  TouchTune 1.2.1 by Miatafy, GPL-3.0-or-later, https://github.com/Miatafy/TouchTune
  Thank you to Miatafy for releasing it as free, open-source software.
  Shipped unmodified; the USB launcher mechanism and the root remount, watchdog
  and SafeReboot handling follow it.

vendor/oem-aa-mod/oem-aa-mod-0.10.0.zip
  oem-aa-mod 0.10.0 by Vitaliy Kurokhtin, AGPL-3.0,
  https://github.com/VitaliyKurokhtin/oem-aa-mod
  Only libpatch-blmjciaapa.so is used, unmodified.

vendor/mzd-aio/
  Images from MZD-AIO by Trevelopment, GPL-3.0, https://github.com/Trevelopment/MZD-AIO
  Shipped unmodified (see vendor/mzd-aio/README.md); the shorter list delay
  follows its "Shorter Delay Mod".

meters/fonts/
  Chakra Petch, Share Tech Mono, Rajdhani (Bold) and Russo One (google/fonts),
  unmodified, SIL Open Font License 1.1, with their license texts alongside.
  Rajdhani and Russo One are used by the Meters Designer only (as "MO Condensed"
  and "MO Sport"); they are not copied to the car.

Idea credits: MZD-AIO additionalApps.js (GPL-3.0) for the userscript approach.

No Mazda or JCI files are included. The scripts only contain hashes of the stock
files they expect and the lines they insert. MiatOff is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mazda.
